es of U.S. securities first surpassed $100 billion in 1993. In 2000, net foreign purchases of U.S. securities set a new record, surpassing the previous one set in 1997. For the year, net purchases amounted to $457 billion, of which $294 billion was reported opposite Europe.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1058, 1106, 1472, 1377], \"page_id\": 88}], \"content\": \"Over the past few years, the composition of foreigners' net purchases has changed dramatically. In the mid-1990s, the majority of foreigners' net purchases consisted of U.S. Treasury bonds and notes. Since 1997, however, foreigners increasingly have turned to other long-term securities. In fact, in 2000, foreigners purchased record amounts of corporate bonds, agency bonds and corporate stocks.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [665, 94, 969, 141], \"page_id\": 89}], \"content\": \"CAPITAL MOVEMENTS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1454, 99, 1492, 141], \"page_id\": 89}], \"content\": \"89\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [180, 177, 1444, 236], \"page_id\": 89}], \"content\": \"SECTION V.\\u2014U.S. International Transactions in Long-Term Securities\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [148, 255, 1481, 306], \"page_id\": 89}], \"content\": \"TA BLE CM-V-1.\\u2014U.S. Transac tions with For eigners in Long-TermDomesticSecuri ties by Type\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [315, 323, 1302, 365], \"page_id\": 89}], \"content\": \"[In mil lions of dol lars; neg a tive fig ures in di cate net sales by for eign ers to U.S. res i d ents or a net out flow of cap i tal from the United States. Source: Trea sury In terna tional Cap i tal Rep orting System]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \