"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [135, 1431, 1497, 1817], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th></th><th>2003</th><th>2004</th><th>2005</th><th>2006</th><th>2007</th></tr><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1.</td><td>12,641</td><td>12,341</td><td>10,579</td><td>9,533</td><td>9,138</td></tr><tr><td>Receipts:</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Excise taxes, net of refunds</td><td>9,381</td><td>10,218</td><td>10,910</td><td>11,537</td><td>12,157</td></tr><tr><td>Interest on investments</td><td>708</td><td>709</td><td>652</td><td>611</td><td>578</td></tr><tr><td>Offsetting collections</td><td>136</td><td>136</td><td>136</td><td>136</td><td>136</td></tr><tr><td>Total receipts</td><td>10,226</td><td>11,063</td><td>11,698</td><td>12,284</td><td>12,871</td></tr><tr><td>Expenses:</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Outlays</td><td>10,390</td><td>12,689</td><td>12,608</td><td>12,543</td><td>12,986</td></tr><tr><td>Offsetting collections</td><td>136</td><td>136</td><td>136</td><td>136</td><td>136</td></tr><tr><td>Balance Sept. 30</td><td>12,341</td><td>10,579</td><td>9,533</td><td>9,138</td><td>8,887</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [135, 1855, 517, 1893], \"page_id\": 117}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014Detail may not add to totals due to rounding.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [718, 94, 911, 130], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"TRUST FUNDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1443, 92, 1488, 127], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"117\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [403, 189, 1228, 278], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"INTRODUCTION: Uranium Enrichment Decontamination and Decommissioning Fund\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 292, 798, 570], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"The Uranium Enrichment Decontamination and Decommissioning Fund was established on the books of the Treasury in fiscal 1993, according to provisions of the Energy Policy Act of 1992 (42 United States Code 2297g). Receipts represent (1) fees collected from domestic public utilities based on their pro rata share of purchases of separative work units from the Department of Energy (DOE) and (2) appropriations toward the Government contribution based on the balance of separative work unit purchases.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 573, 798, 816], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"Expenditures from the fund are for the purpose of (1) decontamination and decommissioning of the three gaseous diffusion plants, (2) remedial actions and related environmental restoration costs at the gaseous diffusion plants and (3) reimbursement to uranium/thorium producers for the costs of decontamination, decommissioning, reclamation and remedial action of uranium/thorium sites that are incident to sales to the U.S. Government.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 818, 798, 971], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"Amounts available in the fund exceeding current needs may be invested by the Secretary of the Treasury in obligations of the United States (1) having maturities congruent with the needs of the fund and (2) bearing interest at rates determined appropriate, taking into consideration the\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 292, 1490, 389], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"current average market yield on outstanding marketable obligations of the United States with remaining periods to maturity comparable to these investments.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 389, 1492, 573], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"The Secretary of the Treasury is required by 42 United States Code 2297g(b)(1) to provide an annual report to Congress, after consultation with the Secretary of Energy. This report must present the financial condition and the results of operations of the fund during the preceding fiscal year.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 573, 1492, 938], \"page_id\": 118}], \"content\": \"The Energy Policy Act of 1992 (42 United States Code 2297g-1, as amended) authorizes funding to ensure annual deposits to the fund of $518.2 million before adjustments for inflation. The Act stipulates that the Government deposit $368.2 million, adjusted for inflation, annually. The Act also calls for deposits of $150 million from domestic public utility assessments. Between the fiscal years of 1993 and 2000, the total Government contribution amount authorized by the Act was $3,791.5 million. During that time span, the Government contributed only $3,122.7 million to the fund. The resulting shortfall in authorized Government contributions is, therefore, $668.8 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 97, 188, 125], \"page_id\": 119}], \"content\": \"118\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [719, 97, 909, 123], \"page_id\": 119}], \"content\": \"TRUST FUNDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [230, 193, 1402, 264], \"page_id\": 119}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-11.\\u2014Uranium Enrichment Decontamination and Decommissioning Fund Results of Operations, Fiscal 2002\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [761, 280, 871, 302], \"page_id\": 119}], \"content\": \"[Source: DOE]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 306, 1486, 936], \"page_id\": 119}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1, 2001</td><td>$963</td></tr><tr><td>Receipts:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Fees collected</td><td>605,682,474</td></tr><tr><td>Penalties collected</td><td>69,051</td></tr><tr><td>Interest on investments</td><td>153,054,291</td></tr><tr><td>Total receipts</td><td>758,805,816</td></tr><tr><td>Outlays:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>DOE, decontamination and decommissioning activities</td><td>328,394,852</td></tr><tr><td>Cost of investments</td><td>430,410,968</td></tr><tr><td>Total outlays</td><td>758,805,820</td></tr><tr><td>Balance Sept. 30, 2002</td><td>$959</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [352, 1049, 1282, 1122], \"page_id\": 119}], \"content\": \"Uranium Enrichment Decontamination and Decommissioning Fund Expected Condition and Results of Operations, Fiscal 2003-2007\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [674, 1134, 956, 1160], \"page_id\": 119}], \"content\": \"(In thousands of dollars. Source: DOE)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [137, 1164, 1492, 1763], \"page_id\": 119}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th></th><th>2003</th><th>2004</th><th>2005</th><th>2006</th><th>2007</th></tr><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1.</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Receipts:</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Fees collected</td><td>608,938</td><td>613,813</td><td>613,813</td><td>623,942</td><td>629,204</td></tr><tr><td>Interest collected</td><td>119,327</td><td>130,621</td><td>141,422</td><td>154,135</td><td>165,258</td></tr><tr><td>Total receipts</td><td>728,265</td><td>744,434</td><td>755,235</td><td>778,077</td><td>794,462</td></tr><tr><td>Outlays:</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>DOE, decontamination and decommissioning fund</td><td>356,472</td><td>431,985</td><td>456,395</td><td>426,352</td><td>486,726</td></tr><tr><td>Costs of investments</td><td>371,793</td><td>312,449</td><td>298,840</td><td>351,725</td><td>307,736</td></tr><tr><td>Total outlays</td><td>728,265</td><td>744,434</td><td>755,235</td><td>778,077</td><td>794,462</td></tr><tr><td>Balance Sept. 30</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [718, 97, 913, 125], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"TRUST FUNDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1437, 94, 1490, 125], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"119\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [364, 191, 1264, 236], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"INTRODUCTION: Black Lung Disability Trust Fund\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 248, 798, 434], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"The Black Lung Disability Trust Fund was established on the books of the Treasury in fiscal 1978 according to the Black Lung Benefits Revenue Act of 1977 (Public Law 95-227). The Black Lung Benefits Revenue Act of 1981 (Public Law 97-119) reestablished the fund in the Internal Revenue Code (IRC), 26 United States Code 9501.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 434, 798, 771], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"The Consolidated Omnibus Budget Reconciliation Act of 1985 (Public Law 99-272), enacted April 7, 1986, provided for an increase in the coal tax effective April 1, 1986, through December 31, 1995, and a 5year forgiveness of interest retroactive to October 1, 1985. The 5-year moratorium on interest payments ended on September 30, 1990. Payment of interest on advances resumed in fiscal 1991. The Omnibus Budget Reconciliation Act of 1987 (Public Law 100-203, title X, section 10503), signed December 22, 1987, extends the temporary increase in the coal tax through December 31, 2013.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 771, 798, 988], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"The Code designates the following receipts to be appropriated and transferred from the general fund of the Treasury to the trust fund: excise taxes on mined coal; taxable expenditures of self-dealing by, and excess contributions to, private black lung benefit trusts; reimbursements by responsible mine operators; and related fines, penalties and interest charges.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 250, 1490, 375], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"Estimates made by the Secretary of the Treasury determine monthly transfers of amounts for excise taxes to the trust fund subject to adjustments in later transfers to actual tax receipts.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 375, 1490, 592], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"After retirement of the current indebtedness, amounts available in the fund exceeding current expenditure requirements will be invested by the Secretary of the Treasury in interest-bearing public debt securities. Any interest earned will be credited to the fund. Also credited, if necessary, will be repayable advances from the general fund to meet outlay requirements exceeding available revenues.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 592, 1490, 773], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"To carry out the program, amounts are made available to the Department of Labor (DOL). Also charged to the fund are administrative expenses incurred by the Department of Health and Human Services (HHS) and the Treasury, repayments of advances from the general fund and interest on advances.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 773, 1490, 988], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"The Code requires the Secretary of the Treasury to submit an annual report to Congress after consultation with the Secretary of Labor and the Secretary of HHS [26 United States Code 9602(a)]. The report must present the financial condition and results of operations of the fund during the past fiscal year and the expected condition and operations of the fund during the next 5 fiscal years.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [457, 1070, 1173, 1143], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-12.\\u2014Black Lung Disability Trust Fund Results of Operations, Fiscal 2002\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [128, 1157, 1490, 1916], \"page_id\": 120}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td colspan=\\\"2\\\">[Source: DOL]</td></tr><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1, 2001</td><td>$38,066,043</td></tr><tr><td>Receipts:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Excise taxes (transferred from general fund):</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>$1.10 tax on underground coal</td><td>149,487,000</td></tr><tr><td>$0.55 tax on surface coal</td><td>148,458,000</td></tr><tr><td>4.4 percent tax on underground coal</td><td>162,310,000</td></tr><tr><td>4.4 percent tax on surface coal</td><td>106,390,000</td></tr><tr><td>Fines, penalties and interest</td><td>621,581</td></tr><tr><td>Collection\\u2014responsible mine operators</td><td>2,591,225</td></tr><tr><td>Recovery of prior year funds</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Repayable advances from the general fund</td><td>465,000,000</td></tr><tr><td>Total receipts</td><td>1,034,857,806</td></tr><tr><td>Net receipts</td><td>1,034,857,806</td></tr><tr><td>Outlays:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Treasury administrative expenses</td><td>34,227</td></tr><tr><td>Salaries and expenses\\u2014DOL\\u2014departmental management</td><td>22,590,000</td></tr><tr><td>Salaries and expenses\\u2014DOL\\u2014Office of Inspector General</td><td>328,000</td></tr><tr><td>Salaries and expenses\\u2014DOL\\u2014Employment Standards Administration</td><td>31,321,000</td></tr><t