able>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 15, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1973, 519, 2001], \"page_id\": 137}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014Detail may not add to totals due to rounding.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 16, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [718, 94, 913, 127], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"TRUST FUNDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1443, 92, 1492, 127], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"137\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [290, 207, 1339, 255], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"INTRODUCTION: Vaccine Injury Compensation Trust Fund\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [137, 262, 794, 521], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"The Vaccine Injury Compensation Trust Fund was created on the books of the Treasury by section 9202 of the Revenue Act of 1987 (Public Law 100-203, approved December 22, 1987). Excise taxes on diphtheria, pertussis, tetanus, measles, mumps, rubella, polio, hepatitis B, haemophilus influenza type b, varicella, rotavirus and pneumococcal conjugate vaccines (26 United States Code 4131) are appropriated into the fund, which is a source of\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [838, 266, 1492, 330], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"funds to pay claims for compensation for vaccine-related injury or death occurring after October 1, 1988.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [838, 330, 1495, 516], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"Annual reports to Congress, required by 26 United States Code 9602(a), are submitted by the Secretary of the Treasury. These reports are required to cover the financial condition and results of operations of the fund during the past fiscal year and those expected during the next 5 fiscal years.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [403, 563, 1231, 644], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-22.\\u2014Vaccine Injury Compensation Trust Fund Results of Operations, Fiscal 2002\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [683, 651, 949, 679], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"(Source: Bureau of the Public Debt)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [153, 679, 1479, 1179], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1, 2001</td><td>$1,702,474,976</td></tr><tr><td>Receipts:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Excise tax receipts</td><td>109,478,250</td></tr><tr><td>Interest on investments</td><td>74,249,445</td></tr><tr><td>Total receipts</td><td>183,727,695</td></tr><tr><td>Outlays:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>U.S. Court of Federal Claims expenses</td><td>1,680,782</td></tr><tr><td>U.S. Department of Justice expenses</td><td>2,122,110</td></tr><tr><td>Total outlays</td><td>3,802,892</td></tr><tr><td>Non-expenditure transfers:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Transfer to Health Resources</td><td>62,802,360</td></tr><tr><td>Total outlays/transfers</td><td>66,605,252</td></tr><tr><td>Balance Sept. 30, 2002</td><td>$1,819,597,420</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [370, 1249, 1262, 1332], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"Vaccine Injury Compensation Trust Fund Expected Condition and Results of Operations, Fiscal 2003-2007\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [528, 1332, 1102, 1367], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"[In thousands of dollars. Source: Department of Health and Human Services]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [137, 1370, 1494, 1839], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th></th><th>2003</th><th>2004</th><th>2005</th><th>2006</th><th>2007</th></tr><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1.</td><td>1,819,597</td><td>1,937,142</td><td>2,058,423</td><td>2,183,553</td><td>2,312,647</td></tr><tr><td>Receipts</td><td>112,762</td><td>116,145</td><td>119,630</td><td>123,218</td><td>126,915</td></tr><tr><td>Interest on investments</td><td>76,476</td><td>78,771</td><td>81,134</td><td>83,568</td><td>86,075</td></tr><tr><td>Total receipts</td><td>189,239</td><td>194,916</td><td>200,763</td><td>206,786</td><td>212,990</td></tr><tr><td>Outlays:</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>U.S. Court of Federal Claims expenses</td><td>2,980</td><td>2,980</td><td>2,980</td><td>2,980</td><td>2,980</td></tr><tr><td>U.S. Department of Justice expenses</td><td>4,028</td><td>4,028</td><td>4,028</td><td>4,028</td><td>4,028</td></tr><tr><td>Total outlays</td><td>7,008</td><td>7,008</td><td>7,008</td><td>7,008</td><td>7,008</td></tr><tr><td>Non-expenditure transfers:</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Transfers to Health Resources</td><td>64,688</td><td>66,627</td><td>68,625</td><td>70,684</td><td>72,805</td></tr><tr><td>Total outlays/transfers</td><td>71,694</td><td>73,635</td><td>75,633</td><td>77,692</td><td>79,813</td></tr><tr><td>Balance Sept. 30</td><td>1,937,142</td><td>2,058,423</td><td>2,183,553</td><td>2,312,647</td><td>2,445,824</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [137, 1855, 526, 1893], \"page_id\": 138}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014Detail may not add to totals due to rounding.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 12, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 97, 188, 125], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"138\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [719, 94, 913, 125], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"TRUST FUNDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [388, 193, 1240, 276], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"INTRODUCTION: Wool Research, Development, and Promotion Trust Fund\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 295, 798, 509], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"The Wool Research, Development, and Promotion Trust Fund was established in fiscal 2000 with a sunset provision effective January, 1, 2004, according to provisions of the Trade and Development Act of 2000 (Public Law 106-200, signed May 18, 2000). The Trade Act of 2002 (Public Law 107-210, signed August 6, 2002) extended the sunset provision to January 1, 2006.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 509, 800, 726], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"The Act provides that the Secretary of the Treasury shall transfer to the trust fund out of the general fund of the U.S. Treasury amounts determined to be equivalent to the duty received on articles under chapters 51 and 52 of the Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States. The amount to be transferred is limited to $2,500,000 in any fiscal year and may be invested in U.S. Treasury securities.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 726, 798, 787], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"The Secretary of Agriculture is authorized to provide grants to a nationally recognized council established for the\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 292, 1490, 389], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"development of the United States wool market for the development of the United States wool market for the following purposes:\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 394, 1492, 488], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"Assist United States wool producers in improving the quality of wool and wool production methods for wool produced in the United States.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 495, 1492, 556], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"Disseminate information on improvements to United States wool producers.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 561, 1490, 625], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"Assist United States wool producers in developing and promoting the wool market.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 627, 1495, 752], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"Annual reports to Congress are required on the financial condition and the results of the operations of the trust fund during the past fiscal year and on its expected condition and operations during the next fiscal year.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [299, 837, 1337, 912], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-23.\\u2014Wool Research, Development, and Promotion Trust Fund Results of Operations, Fiscal 2002\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [601, 922, 1029, 948], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"[In thousands of dollars. Source: Department of Agriculture]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 12, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 955, 1486, 1306], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1, 2001</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Receipts:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Harmonized Tariff</td><td>2,250</td></tr><tr><td>Total Receipts</td><td>2,250</td></tr><tr><td>Expenses:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Expenditure</td><td>2,250</td></tr><tr><td>Total expenses</td><td>2,250</td></tr><tr><td>Balance Sept. 30, 2002</td><td>-</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 13, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [408, 1379, 1222, 1457], \"page_id\": 139}], \"content\": \"Wool Research, Development, and Promotion Trust Fund\\nExpected Condition and Results of Operations, Fiscal 2003\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\"